  61f3a1d0 nak: use correct src_type for OpBSSy bar_in
  77781ae8 nak: fix insert order when annotate is off
  93746520 nak: never encode IDP.4A with an immediate source
  a79e3fc7 nak: Move FutureReadyInstr::new into postpass.rs
  b6b973d0 nak: Fix ready_cycle calculation in prepass sched
  5e4bcb1c nak,nvk: Increase nir_opt_peephole limit
  801952de nak: Fix missing scoreboard for uniform Ldcg on SM120
  83a732aa nak: Increase sm120 imma/hmma latencies
  3b3084bf nak: Derive copy and clone in lat_rs_gen
  cb0e7868 nak: Always apply opt_fall_through

